 them strategically to defeat powerful rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/link.png?t=1743055250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards not only have individual effects but can also demonstrate greater power by 'linking' with other cards. Discover hidden synergies and find the strongest combinations to overwhelm your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/strategy.png?t=1743055250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own tactics from over 50 unique cards and more than 50 link cards. Prove your strength through flexible thinking and strategy in battles against a variety of randomly generated opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["MediaLabGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/32eac27d8b7f6eef0c30a1fb84843efb06852885/header.jpg?t=1743055250","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"NOVEMS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li>